87
00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.380
It was.

88
00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:44.420
Oh, my gosh.

89
00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:45.320
I see how it is.

90
00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:46.260
