102
00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:16.740
One, everyone at Dunder Mifflin is being issued an ID badge.

103
00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:21.800
So, one by one, people go into the break room and have their photo taken for their badge.

104
00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:29.660
And then, secondly, Michael takes the stack of employee complaints from Toby and starts

105
00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:34.980
trying to resolve them one by one by forcing people to confront one another at work.

106
00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:35.220
Yeah.

107
00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.780
So, I have one little thing about this episode.

108
00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:43.780
So, Dwight is, like, going on and on about how horrible the security is at the office, right?

109
00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:44.620
At Dunder Mifflin.

110
00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:45.060
