116
00:04:58.220 --> 00:05:04.280
And Hank is in the scene, and Hank keeps insisting that Dwight show his ID badge,

117
00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:07.940
and he pretends like he can't read it, and then Dwight misses the elevator.

118
00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:12.240
So, I guess we wore them once for a tag that never aired.

119
00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:13.700
Right.

120
00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:15.560
But, no, we don't ever.

121
00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:18.060
It's, you know, it's sort of the Casual Friday of it all.

122
00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:18.480
It is.

123
00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:18.700
Right?

124
00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:19.600
It really is.

125
00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:19.840
Yeah.

126
00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:20.480
It really is.

127
00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:20.900
It really.

