00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:36.880
from filming this episode.

162
00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:42.580
He said he remembers that Ricky Gervais came to visit set this week, and everyone was abuzz.

163
00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:50.040
He said that Ricky seemed delighted and surprised by the scale of the production of our set and

164
00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:55.700
everything, compared to maybe what his production of it had been like in the U.K., and he said

165
00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:57.780
that Ricky was just very humble and sweet.

166
00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:58.580
Oh, my gosh.

167
00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:01.840
I did not remember that Ricky visited during this episode.

168
00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:06.980
Yeah, I mean, he popped by in and out those first couple seasons, you know, but Scott remembered

169
00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:10.700
meeting him, and he just said that he was just really nice.

170
00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:11.280
Oh, my gosh.

171
00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:14.180
That's like a fast fact within a fast fact.

