175
00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:18.820
You did.

176
00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:19.480
You did.

177
00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:23.520
Angela, I have a fun fact within this fast fact.

178
00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:28.640
Both you and Scott have appeared in two episodes of the TV show Monk.

179
00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:31.660
I was in one episode, yes, and I played the murderer.

180
00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:34.940
Well, Scott was on seasons three and four.

181
00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:39.980
So, between the two of you, you cover four seasons of Monk.

182
00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:40.920
Congratulations.

183
00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:42.560
That's my fun fact.

184
00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:47.600
Monk was so much fun to shoot, and Tony Shalhoub was the niceSt.

185
00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:53.900
We sat on like a little bench in between scenes, and he was throwing something to try to get

186
00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:58.480
it in the trash can, and when it hit the trash can, it made like a ping-wong.

187
00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:02.740
And I started laughing, and he started laughing, and I said, I mean, that was kind of a funny

188
00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:03.100
noise.

