00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:41.420
This episode was filmed during May 2006.

253
00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:50.400
And so, Angela, my question for both of us is, what were you doing flashback now to May 2006?

254
00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:51.500
And what were you up to?

255
